SUMMARY:NJ Audubon: Birding With Technology at Hawk Rise Sanctuary
DESCRIPTION:Led by Angus Macaulay\, NJ Audubon Teacher Naturalist \nCan technology improve your birding experience? Join us on the trails Hawk Rise Wildlife Sanctuary and find out. We will use phone apps to help identify\, locate\, and record birds as we walk the trails. The primary apps for this program will be Merlin Bird ID and eBird by Cornell Lab. You may consider installing these apps in advance. This program is appropriate for individuals of all ages. Come dressed for the weather. Cold beverages will be served afterwards. \nCOST: FREE \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE \n 
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/nj-audubon-birding-with-technology-at-hawk-rise-sanctuary-2/
LOCATION:Hawk Rise Sanctuary\, 1811 Lower Rd\, Linden\, NJ\, 07036\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bird Walk,Birding,Family Program,Hawk Rise,Nature Walk,Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/DSC_0764.jpg
GEO:40.6041342249;-74.252034991
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Hawk Rise Sanctuary 1811 Lower Rd Linden NJ 07036 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1811 Lower Rd:geo:-74.252034991,40.6041342249
END:VEVENT
